; Self test of the TED bug-orig tests (tests/bug-orig/CMakeLists.txt): the
; expectation is what the original TED does (blitz2 without a file, QUIT,
; the command's output ends with rc=0), so tedab must report the test as
; BROKEN (exit status 3), not as a reproduced bug.
; @source none
; @expect stdout "rc=0"
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 0 9
wait exit
